OL,3,GNEWSALife in the shadow of RAF 'spy'
OL,4,Abase post Fairford
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham says an
OL,7,Fincident at RAF Fairford, which
OL,8,Fresulted in multiple arrests, was
OL,9,F"almost certainly directed by Iran's
OL,10,FIslamic Revolutionary Guard". With the
OL,11,Fcurrent threat level at severe, meaning
OL,12,Fan attack is likely, the public is
OL,13,Furged to remain vigilant around
OL,14,Fmilitary sites.
OL,16,F"I must admit I was starting to wonder
OL,17,Fwho you were," Chris Nicholas tells me,
OL,18,Fa step ladder slung over one shoulder
OL,19,Fand a camera over the other.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
