OL,3,GNEWSALife in the shadow of RAF 'spy'
OL,4,Abase post Fairford
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe retired chemist looks me up and
OL,7,Fdown, adding: "You're not carrying a
OL,8,Fcamera. You stand out..."
OL,10,FChris informs me he had clocked my car
OL,11,Fturning off the A15 and into the
OL,12,FWaddington Aircraft Viewing Enclosure,
OL,13,F(known by its acronym WAVE), opposite
OL,14,FRAF Waddington in Lincolnshire, where
OL,15,Fwe are standing.
